The `list_applications` function currently orders by `-received`, so I'll change it to order by `reference`. I'm assuming ascending order is wanted, since the request doesn't specify a direction. [tool_use propose_change {"path":"register/views.py","summary":"Order applications by reference instead of received date (ascending).","diff":"--- a/register/views.py\n+++ b/register/views.py\n@@ -3,5 +3,5 @@\n \n def list_applications(request, appl_status=None):\n     appl = Application.objects.filter(status=appl_status) if appl_status else Application.objects.all()\n-    return paginate(appl.order_by(\"-received\"), PAGE_SIZE)\n+    return paginate(appl.order_by(\"reference\"), PAGE_SIZE)\n"}]
